    "text": "McDonald's second card campaign of 2002 in Japan, in May and June: one card to an opaque sealed pack with each Happy Meal. The nine cards, Hoppip 029/P to Scizor 037/P, are alternate-art versions of cards from the first e-Card set, the Base Expansion Pack, or from Wind from the Sea, the set released that May, with McDonald's logo beside the promo star.",
